// 插件商城 settings page (options window ▶ 插件, id store.repos): automatic
// update checks and the repositories. Width 440: 6px padding leaves 428; a
// repository row is name / address (stretch) and a 50px 「移除」 button.
import { LineEdit, ListView } from "std-widgets.slint";
import { Theme } from "@vestra/theme.slint";
import { Button } from "@vestra/widgets.slint";
import { Cell, Check, Tone } from "parts.slint";

export struct RepoRow {
    name: string,
    url: string,
    note: string,
    // 0 plain, 2 warn (see Tone)
    tone: int,
    removable: bool,
}

export global StoreSettings {
    in property <bool> auto-check: true;
    in property <[RepoRow]> repos;
    in property <bool> adding;
    in-out property <string> add-text;
    in property <bool> can-add: true;
    in property <string> message;
    in property <bool> message-warn;
    callback toggle-auto();
    callback start-add();
    callback add(string);
    callback cancel-add();
    callback remove(string);
}

export component StorePage inherits Rectangle {
    height: 400px;
    VerticalLayout {
        padding: 6px;
        spacing: 6px;
        Check {
            text: "自动检查更新（播放器启动 30 秒后一次，之后每 24 小时）";
            checked: StoreSettings.auto-check;
            clicked => { StoreSettings.toggle-auto(); }
        }
        Text {
            text: "关闭后只在打开插件商城或点「刷新」时联网；被仓库撤回的插件也只在这时停用。有可以更新的插件时，菜单「插件商城…」会显示数量。";
            color: Theme.text-dim;
            font-size: Theme.font-body;
            wrap: word-wrap;
            line-height-factor: 1.25;
        }
        Rectangle { height: 4px; }
        Cell { text: "仓库"; color: Theme.text; }
        Rectangle {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            background: Theme.bg-list;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            ListView {
                x: 1px;
                y: 1px;
                width: parent.width - 2px;
                height: parent.height - 2px;
                for repo in StoreSettings.repos: HorizontalLayout {
                    height: 38px;
                    padding-left: 6px;
                    padding-right: 10px;
                    spacing: 6px;
                    VerticalLayout {
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                        alignment: center;
                        Cell { text: repo.name; color: Theme.text; }
                        Cell { text: repo.url; color: Theme.text-dim; }
                        if repo.note != "": Cell { text: repo.note; color: Tone.color(repo.tone); }
                    }
                    VerticalLayout {
                        width: 50px;
                        alignment: center;
                        if repo.removable: Button {
                            small: true;
                            text: "移除";
                            clicked => { StoreSettings.remove(repo.url); }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        if !StoreSettings.adding: HorizontalLayout {
            height: Theme.button-height;
            Button {
                width: 84px;
                text: "添加仓库…";
                enabled: StoreSettings.can-add;
                clicked => { StoreSettings.start-add(); }
            }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
        }
        // One line: address, 添加, 取消 (Enter adds, Esc cancels). The fluent
        // LineEdit asks for 32px; pinned to input-height (as the row) it stays
        // inside the row, so the warning below starts under it.
        if StoreSettings.adding: FocusScope {
            height: Theme.input-height;
            key-pressed(event) => {
                if event.text == Key.Escape {
                    StoreSettings.cancel-add();
                    return accept;
                }
                return reject;
            }
            HorizontalLayout {
                spacing: 6px;
                address := LineEdit {
                    height: Theme.input-height;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    font-size: Theme.font-body;
                    placeholder-text: "仓库根地址或 index.json 的完整地址（https://…）";
                    text <=> StoreSettings.add-text;
                    accepted(text) => { StoreSettings.add(text); }
                    init => { self.focus(); }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    Button { width: 52px; text: "添加"; clicked => { StoreSettings.add(address.text); } }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    Button { width: 52px; text: "取消"; clicked => { StoreSettings.cancel-add(); } }
                }
            }
        }
        Text {
            text: "第三方仓库未经 Vestra Player 审核，其中的插件可能读取你的文件或联网。只添加你信任的仓库。官方仓库不能移除；不想联网时可以在「插件管理」里停用插件商城。";
            color: Tone.warn;
            font-size: Theme.font-body;
            wrap: word-wrap;
            line-height-factor: 1.25;
        }
        if StoreSettings.message != "": Text {
            text: StoreSettings.message;
            color: StoreSettings.message-warn ? Tone.warn : Theme.text-dim;
            font-size: Theme.font-body;
            wrap: word-wrap;
            line-height-factor: 1.25;
        }
    }
}
